1
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:08,030
An OCO order places two orders at once. When one trades, the other is cancelled.

2
00:00:08,130 --> 00:00:11,840
Right click an instrument and choose Entry OCO Buy.

3
00:00:11,940 --> 00:00:15,200
It opens on the OCO tab.

4
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:19,280
The Stop rate buys if the price breaks up above it.

5
00:00:19,380 --> 00:00:24,160
The Limit rate buys if the price dips down to it.

6
00:00:24,260 --> 00:00:30,490
Click Buy to place both orders together.

7
00:00:30,590 --> 00:00:34,710
Both orders now wait under Pending.

8
00:00:34,810 --> 00:00:39,210
As soon as one of them trades, the other one is cancelled for you.

